{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1502380-renegade-publishes-vampire-5e-players-guide","id":1502380,"title":"Renegade publishes VAMPIRE 5E PLAYERS GUIDE","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-02-07T05:51:52-08:00","id":1502380,"title":"Renegade publishes VAMPIRE 5E PLAYERS GUIDE","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition-roleplaying-game-player-s-guide/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-kftzvkkgjv/products/797/images/2302/RGS09623-vampire-TM-5thEd-players-guide-2000px-shadow-3D-v2023__21857.1675954931.386.513.png?c=1\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition-roleplaying-game-player-s-guide/\" target=\"_blank\"> Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition Roleplaying Game Players Guide PRE-ORDER </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition-roleplaying-game-player-s-guide/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://renegadegamestudios.com/vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition-roleplaying-game-player-s-guide/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Renegade Games Online Store </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <i><b>Description</b><br /> <br /> Pre-order now for a June 2023 release!<br /> <br /> For a limited time, pre-orders will come with a PDF copy of the Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition Roleplaying Game Player\u2019s Guide at no additional cost. Any order cancellation involving a free PDF will only refund the price of the physical book minus the price of the PDF.<br /> <br /> The PDF will be added to your account upon release.<br /> <br /> Mature Content Warning: contains graphic and written content of a mature nature, including violence, sexual themes, and strong language. Reader discretion is advised.<br /> <br /> <b>CHILDREN OF CAINE</b><br /> <br /> The children of the night \u2013 what games they play! And what games can we play with them?<br /> <br /> Vampires have lurked among us since the first cities rose nameless by the Euphrates. They command mighty powers and strange magics, they hunt in singular ways, they even flock together when times demand it.<br /> <br /> This book collects new character-building options, powers, guides for playing together and alone and virtually, and new ways to use the old rules of Vampire: The Masquerade. The Players Guide is the perfect companion to the core Vampire: The Masquerade rulebook!<br /> <br /> Features:<br /> <br /> * Consolidates 7 clans of Kindred not included in the core Vampire: The Masquerade rulebook: Banu Haqim, Hecata, Lasombra, The Ministry, Ravnos, Salubri, and Tzimisce with their iconic<br /> * Discipline powers including Oblivion and its Ceremonies!<br /> * Collects previously published Discipline Powers, Blood Sorcery Rituals, and Thin-Blood Alchemy Formulae, plus includes over 40 new additions.<br /> * New systems and advantages for coteries, including clan coterie merits for each of the 13 great clans plus Caitiff, Duskborn, and Salubri.<br /> * Revisits all aspects of character and coterie creations, including streamlined guidance for new or experienced players.<br /> * Guidelines and advice for non-traditional chronicles, including: all Thin-blood, troupe-style, virtual play, and play without a Storyteller.</i><br /> <br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 02-08-2023, 07:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-07T06:16:44-08:00","id":1502384,"title":"","content":"Cool. Just short of 5 years after the release of V5 they finally release a book with all 13 clans in it. Truely an inspiring publishing schedule that shows the success with which Paradox has managed white wolf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5617-vendrin","name":"Vendrin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5617_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-07T07:11:17-08:00","id":1502387,"title":"","content":"Is the book actually released? It says June 2023 release?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-07T07:14:03-08:00","id":1502388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1502380-renegade-publishes-vampire-5e-players-guide?p=1502387#post1502387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is the book actually released? It says June 2023 release?</div> </div> </div> </div>The pdf will come earlier","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://fo